  "description": "Atmospheric reentry system design: the blunt-body capsule geometry, ablative and reusable heat shield, and deceleration sequence that return a crew from orbital or lunar return velocity to a survivable landing. Covers PICA-X and Avcoat ablator heat shields, the 3-4 g lifting entry trajectory, drogue and main parachute or propulsive touchdown, and the load-limiting couches that protect crew during peak g.",
